## Bug Log

| # | File | Bug | Severity | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `index.js` | `SIGINT` handler indented inside `run()` body — misleading scope | Low | ⚠️ Cosmetic (works) |
| 2 | `index.js` | `rl.on("close")` registered after `run()` call | Low | ⚠️ Cosmetic (works) |
| 3 | `geminiClient.js` | Default model name was incorrect | High | ✅ Acknowledged — user confirmed working model from docs |
| 4 | `geminiClient.js` | `config.maxTokens` ≠ `maxOutputTokens` from caller | Medium | ✅ Fixed — changed to `config.maxOutputTokens` |
| 5 | `contextBuilder.js` | Dead import of `geminiClient.js` — circular dep risk | Medium | ✅ Fixed — import deleted |
| 6 | `index.js` | Used `buildPrompt` instead of `buildPromptWithTools` | High | ✅ Fixed — swapped to correct function |

